{"n":60,"name":"Al-Mumtahanah","nameAr":"الممتحنة","meaning":"She that is to be examined","ayahs":13,"place":"madinah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":28,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَا تَتَّخِذُوا۟ عَدُوِّى وَعَدُوَّكُمْ أَوْلِيَآءَ تُلْقُونَ إِلَيْهِم بِٱلْمَوَدَّةِ وَقَدْ كَفَرُوا۟ بِمَا جَآءَكُم مِّنَ ٱلْحَقِّ يُخْرِجُونَ ٱلرَّسُولَ وَإِيَّاكُمْ ۙ أَن تُؤْمِنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ رَبِّكُمْ إِن كُنتُمْ خَرَجْتُمْ جِهَـٰدًا فِى سَبِيلِى وَٱبْتِغَآءَ مَرْضَاتِى ۚ تُسِرُّونَ إِلَيْهِم بِٱلْمَوَدَّةِ وَأَنَا۠ أَعْلَمُ بِمَآ أَخْفَيْتُمْ وَمَآ أَعْلَنتُمْ ۚ وَمَن يَفْعَلْهُ مِنكُمْ فَقَدْ ضَلَّ سَوَآءَ ٱلسَّبِيلِ","en":"O you who have believed, do not take My enemies and your enemies as allies, extending to them affection while they have disbelieved in what came to you of the truth, having driven out the Prophet and yourselves [only] because you believe in Allāh, your Lord. If you have come out for jihād [i.e., fighting or striving] in My cause and seeking means to My approval, [take them not as friends]. You confide to them affection [i.e., instruction], but I am most knowing of what you have concealed and what you have declared. And whoever does it among you has certainly strayed from the soundness of the way.","w":[{"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","tr":"yāayyuhā","en":"O you","root":"أيي","lem":"أَيّ"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"who"},{"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","tr":"āmanū","en":"believe","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"(Do) not"},{"ar":"تَتَّخِذُوا۟","tr":"tattakhidhū","en":"take","root":"أخذ","lem":"اتَّخَذَ"},{"ar":"عَدُوِّى","tr":"ʿaduwwī","en":"My enemies","root":"عدو","lem":"عَدُوّ"},{"ar":"وَعَدُوَّكُمْ","tr":"waʿaduwwakum","en":"and your enemies","root":"عدو","lem":"عَدُوّ"},{"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءَ","tr":"awliyāa","en":"(as) allies","root":"ولي","lem":"وَلِيّ"},{"ar":"تُلْقُونَ","tr":"tul'qūna","en":"offering","root":"لقي","lem":"أَلْقَى"},{"ar":"إِلَيْهِم","tr":"ilayhim","en":"them"},{"ar":"بِٱلْمَوَدَّةِ","tr":"bil-mawadat