{"ar":"أَعْلَنتُمْ ۚ","tr":"aʿlantum","en":"you declare","root":"علن","lem":"أَعْلَن"},{"ar":"وَمَن","tr":"waman","en":"And whoever"},{"ar":"يَفْعَلْهُ","tr":"yafʿalhu","en":"does it","root":"فعل","lem":"فَعَلَ"},{"ar":"مِنكُمْ","tr":"minkum","en":"among you"},{"ar":"فَقَدْ","tr":"faqad","en":"then certainly"},{"ar":"ضَلَّ","tr":"ḍalla","en":"he has strayed","root":"ضلل","lem":"ضَلَّ"},{"ar":"سَوَآءَ","tr":"sawāa","en":"(from the) straight","root":"سوي","lem":"سَواء"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّبِيلِ","tr":"l-sabīli","en":"path","root":"سبل","lem":"سَبِيل"}]},{"n":2,"juz":28,"ar":"إِن يَثْقَفُوكُمْ يَكُونُوا۟ لَكُمْ أَعْدَآءً وَيَبْسُطُوٓا۟ إِلَيْكُمْ أَيْدِيَهُمْ وَأَلْسِنَتَهُم بِٱلسُّوٓءِ وَوَدُّوا۟ لَوْ تَكْفُرُونَ","en":"If they gain dominance over you, they would be [i.e., behave] to you as enemies and extend against you their hands and their tongues with evil, and they wish you would disbelieve.","w":[{"ar":"إِن","tr":"in","en":"If"},{"ar":"يَثْقَفُوكُمْ","tr":"yathqafūkum","en":"they gain dominance over you","root":"ثقف","lem":"ثُقِفُ"},{"ar":"يَكُونُوا۟","tr":"yakūnū","en":"they would be","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"لَكُمْ","tr":"lakum","en":"to you"},{"ar":"أَعْدَآءًۭ","tr":"aʿdāan","en":"enemies","root":"عدو","lem":"عَدُوّ"},{"ar":"وَيَبْسُطُوٓا۟","tr":"wayabsuṭū","en":"and extend","root":"بسط","lem":"بَسَطَ"},{"ar":"إِلَيْكُمْ","tr":"ilaykum","en":"against you"},{"ar":"أَيْدِيَهُمْ","tr":"aydiyahum","en":"their hands","root":"يدي","lem":"يَد"},{"ar":"وَأَلْسِنَتَهُم","tr":"wa-alsinatahum","en":"and their tongues","root":"لسن","lem":"لِسان"},{"ar":"بِٱلسُّوٓءِ","tr":"bil-sūi","en":"with evil","root":"سوأ","lem":"سُوء"},{"ar":"وَوَدُّوا۟","tr":"wawaddū","en":"and they desire","root":"ودد","lem":"وَدَّ"},{"ar":"لَوْ","tr":"law","en":"that"},{"ar":"تَكْفُرُونَ","tr":"takfurūna","en":"you would disbelieve","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"}]},{"n":3,"juz":28,"ar":"لَن تَنفَعَكُمْ أَرْحَامُكُمْ وَلَآ أَوْلَـٰدُكُمْ ۚ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ يَفْصِلُ بَيْنَكُمْ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ بَصِيرٌ","en":"Never will your relatives or your children benefit you; the Day of Resurrection He will judge between you. And Allāh, of what you do, is Seeing.","w":[{"ar":"لَن","tr":"lan","en":"Never"},{"ar":"تَنفَعَكُمْ","tr":"tanfaʿakum","en":"will benefit you","root":"نفع","lem":"نَفَعَ"},{"ar":"أَرْحَامُكُمْ","tr":"arḥāmukum","en":"your relatives","root":"رحم","lem":"أَرْحام"},{"ar":"وَلَآ","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"أَوْلَـٰدُكُمْ ۚ","tr":"awlādukum","en":"your children","root":"ولد","lem":"وَلَد"},{"ar":"يَوْمَ","tr":"yawma","en":"(on the) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","tr":"l-qiyāmati","en":"(of) the Resurrection","root":"قوم","lem":"قِيامَة"},{"ar":"يَفْصِلُ","tr":"yafṣilu","en":"He will judge","root":"فصل","lem":"فَصَلَ"},{"ar":"بَيْنَكُمْ ۚ","tr":"baynakum","en":"between you","root":"بين","lem":"بَيْن"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"بِمَا","tr":"bimā","en":"of what"},{"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","tr":"taʿmalūna","en":"you do","root":"عمل","lem":"عَمِلَ"},{"ar":"بَصِيرٌۭ","tr":"baṣīrun","en":"(is) All-Seer","root":"بصر","lem":"بَصِير"}]},{"n":4,"juz":28,"ar":"قَدْ كَانَتْ لَكُمْ أُسْوَةٌ حَسَنَةٌ فِىٓ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَٱلَّذِينَ مَعَهُۥٓ إِذْ قَالُوا۟ لِقَوْمِهِمْ إِنَّا بُرَءَٰٓؤُا۟ مِنكُمْ وَمِمَّا تَعْبُدُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ كَفَرْنَا بِكُمْ وَبَدَا بَيْنَنَا وَبَيْنَكُمُ ٱلْعَدَٰوَةُ وَٱلْبَغْضَآءُ أَبَدًا حَتَّىٰ تُؤْمِنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَحْدَهُۥٓ إِلَّا قَوْلَ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ لِأَبِيهِ لَأَسْتَغْفِرَنَّ لَكَ وَمَآ أَمْلِكُ لَكَ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ مِن شَىْءٍ ۖ رَّبَّنَا عَلَيْكَ تَوَكَّلْنَا وَإِلَيْكَ أَنَبْنَا وَإِلَيْكَ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en":"There has already been for you an excellent pattern in Abraham and those with him, when they said to their people, \"Indeed, we are disassociated from you and from whatever you worship other than Allāh. We have denied you, and there has appeared between us and you animosity and hatred forever until you believe in Allāh alone\" - except for the saying of Abraham to his father, \"I will surely ask forgiveness for you, but I have not [power to do] for you anything against Allāh. Our Lord, upon You we have relied, and to You we have returned, and to You is the destination.","w":[{"ar":"قَدْ","tr":"qad","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"كَانَتْ","tr":"kānat","en":"(there) is","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"لَكُمْ","tr":"lakum","en":"for you"},{"ar":"أُسْوَةٌ","tr":"us'watun","en":"an example","root":"أسو","lem":"أُسْوَة"},{"ar":"حَسَنَةٌۭ","tr":"ḥasanatun","en":"good","root":"حسن","lem":"حَسَنَة"},{"ar":"فِىٓ","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","tr":"ib'rāhīma","en":"Ibrahim"},{"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"wa-alladhīna","en":"and those"},{"ar":"مَعَهُۥٓ","tr":"maʿahu","en":"with him"},{"ar":"إِذْ","tr":"idh","en":"when"},{"ar":"قَالُوا۟","tr":"qālū","en":"they said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"لِقَوْمِهِمْ","tr":"liqawmihim","en":"to their people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, we"},{"ar":"بُرَءَٰٓؤُا۟","tr":"buraāu","en":"(are) disassociated","root":"برأ","lem":"بَرِيء"},{"ar":"مِنكُمْ","tr":"minkum","en":"from you"},{"ar":"وَمِمَّا","tr":"wamimmā","en":"and from what"},{"ar":"تَعْبُدُونَ","tr":"taʿbudūna","en":"you worship","root":"عبد","lem":"عَبَدَ"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"دُونِ","tr":"dūni","en":"besides","root":"دون","lem":"دُون"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"كَفَرْنَا","tr":"kafarnā","en":"We have denied","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"},{"ar":"بِكُمْ","tr":"bikum","en":"you"},{"ar":"وَبَدَا","tr":"wabadā","en":"and has appeared","root":"بدو","lem":"بَدا"},{"ar":"بَيْنَنَا","tr":"baynanā","en":"between us","root":"بين","lem":"بَيْن"},{"ar":"وَبَيْنَكُمُ","tr":"wabaynakumu","en":"and between you","root":"بين","lem":"بَيْن"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَدَٰوَةُ","tr":"l-ʿadāwatu","en":"enmity","root":"عدو","lem":"عَداوَة"},{"ar":"وَٱلْبَغْضَآءُ","tr":"wal-baghḍāu","en":"and hatred","root":"بغض","lem":"